1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,450
(Seibert:)and I sympathize,
but the hard facts are,

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,720
(Seibert:)occasionally,
we have to shake a few hands

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,820
(Seibert:)and kiss a few butts
to raise money for our research.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,670
I don't care;
it's demeaning.

5
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:11,070
(Sheldon:)And I refuse to be
trotted out and shown off

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,310
(Sheldon:)like a prize hog
at the Texas State Fair.

7
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:15,940
(Sheldon:)Which, by the way, is something
you don't want to attend

8
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:18,480
(Sheldon:)wearing a Star Trek
ensign's uniform.

9
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,620
(Seibert:)All right,

10
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,080
(Seibert:)let me put it this way.

11
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:23,790
(Seibert:)You're gonna put on a suit,
you're gonna come to this party,

12
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:25,490
(Seibert:)and you're gonna
