13
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,960
(Seibert:)to a bunch of old people,

14
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,960
(Seibert:)or I swear to God,
I'll blind you with a hot spoon,

15
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:33,230
like they did  to that little boy
in Slumdog Millionaire.

16
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:35,200
(Raj:)Oh, you don't want that.

17
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,600
(Seibert:)So, Saturday night!

18
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,400
(Seibert:)It's gonna be
off the hook.
Ugh!

19
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,400
(Seibert:)Get over it.

20
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,070
(Raj:)Oh, boy!

21
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:46,110
(Raj:)Tator tots and
a party invitation?

22
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:47,910
(Raj:)What a great day!

